# Valgrind suppressions for native-checks.yaml (r-actions valgrind.yml,
# `suppressions` input). Each entry names a finding that is not this
# package's, and the issue that tracks it; remove it when that closes.

# cli starts a thread for its progress ticks; in a child that
# parallel::mcparallel() forks (tests/testthat/test-fork.R) the thread is
# gone but its TLS block, allocated by pthread_create, is "possibly lost".
# Only that stack: a possible leak of a thread's TLS created from cli.so.
# pedrobtz/r-actions#131.
{
   cli-thread-tls-in-forked-child
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: possible
   fun:calloc
   ...
   fun:_dl_allocate_tls
   ...
   fun:pthread_create*
   obj:*/cli/libs/cli.so
}
